# .dockerignore — exclusion-based, per REPO-BASELINE.md §1.
#
# The failure this prevents: the service image build shipping the whole repository
# as build context — the eval corpus, the docs (including two LaTeX papers and their
# rendered figures), the tests, and the .git directory — which slows every build and
# puts files in the image that have no reason to be reachable from a running
# container.
#
# Rule: this file excludes; the Dockerfile copies only the project files it restores
# and then the source it compiles (P6). Order matters — the re-inclusions at the
# bottom undo a blanket exclusion above them.

# ─── Source control and CI ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.editorconfig
.claude

# ─── Secrets. Belt and braces: these are gitignored, but a developer's working
#     tree is the build context, and an uncommitted .env would otherwise be
#     copied into the image. ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
secrets.env
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key

# ─── IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs
.vscode
.idea
*.user
*.suo
*.DS_Store

# ─── Build output — the image builds its own ─────────────────────────────────
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/artifacts
**/coverage
**/node_modules

# ─── Not part of any runtime image ───────────────────────────────────────────
docs/
evals/
scripts/
tests/
k8s/
docker-compose.yml
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
LICENSE
*.md

# …except the fixtures, which ARE the catalogue the in-memory index serves. The
# service links them from evals/fixtures/ rather than keeping a second copy, so the
# corpus the scenarios describe and the corpus the service loads cannot drift apart.
# The Dockerfile copies this path explicitly; without the re-inclusion the build
# fails at that COPY.
!evals/fixtures/
!evals/fixtures/**

# ─── Aspire AppHost: a development-time composition root (P1), never containerized ──
src/ListingSearch.AppHost/

# ─── The eval harness: it grades the service, it never ships inside it ───────
src/ListingSearch.Service/bin
src/ListingSearch.Service/obj
